# name: microsoft-outlook-mail
# priority: 104
# section: microsoft
# description: Outlook 与 Exchange Online 邮箱入口
# boundary: 收个人和工作邮箱、客户端邮件主机；共享 Entra 登录独立，不能覆盖每个租户自己的域名。
# created-at: 2026-11-19T11:46:30Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-20T02:14:16Z
# rule-count: 11
# source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/enterprise/urls-and-ip-address-ranges
# source: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/outlook/pop-imap-and-smtp-settings-for-outlook-com
# source: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/outlook/getstarted/what-version-of-outlook-do-i-have

DOMAIN,outlook.com
DOMAIN,outlook.live.com
DOMAIN,outlook.cloud.microsoft
DOMAIN,outlook.office.com
DOMAIN,outlook.office365.com
DOMAIN,smtp.office365.com
DOMAIN,smtp-mail.outlook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,acompli.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,outlookmobile.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.mx.microsoft
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.protection.outlook.com
